## ❌ No Frameworks or Templating Engines

Use only plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.

Do not use:
- React, Vue, Angular, Svelte, or other JS frameworks.
- JSX, Handlebars, or any templating engines.

This project must remain lightweight and framework-free.
